- Extend `base.html`. Utility Tailwind v4. Partial HTMX untuk tab/progress.
- Baca `docs/DESIGN.md`: aksen teal, radius 6px, angka mono.
- Chart.js di tab equity/MC. Satu library chart.
- Form: widget Django + class Tailwind, bukan JS form builder.

